        <div class="description-box mx-auto" style="max-width: 1000px;">
            <p>Compact yet capable, DJI Neo flies with style. It not only supports controller-free aerial filming but can also be paired with the DJI Fly app, remote controllers, RC Motion, DJI Goggles, and more for increased flight and camera control.</p>
